      "id": "claim_8a90ceac0c494fe2bf8765959d338a9a",
      "statement": "Item and container image paths are stored relative to image_dir with the subdirectory included (items/{uuid}.{ext}, items/{uuid}_thumb.{ext}, containers/{uuid}.{ext}); main mounts image_dir at /images via nest_service(ServeDir), and the SPA composes media URLs by prepending /images/ to the stored string.",
