      "statement": "Item deletion removes image originals and thumbnails from disk but never the item's PDFs, and container deletion touches no files at all: item::delete takes only image_dir and iterates item_images, container::delete is SQL-only, and there is no route to clear or replace containers.image_path without orphaning the previous file.",
