      "id": "claim_3d4a2fe44db9416d8377900696b22c28",
      "statement": "Delete and validation ordering leak files: save_image writes the original before image::load_from_memory validates it, and both image handlers write files before inserting the DB row, so a rejected non-image or a failed insert leaves files in image_dir with no compensating unlink and no reconciliation job.",
