      "statement": "Because serve_image stores the first-uploaded-order thumbnail in ItemSummary.thumb_path (lowest sort_order) while add_image assigns sort_order as MAX+1, list and search views depend on the lowest-sort_order item_images row's thumb_path existing on disk, and it is NULL when the item has no image.",
