      "id": "claim_4f67a43f45724e4594800cf35dfc6d57",
      "statement": "Storage roots are re-read from Config::load() inside each upload/delete request, but the ServeDir mounts for /images and /docs are fixed at boot from the startup config value, so editing image_dir or docs_dir in config.toml while the process runs makes new writes land outside the served directories until the binary is restarted.",
