    {
      "id": "claim_669418c81a5d456eb911b600c45caf81",
      "statement": "Current documentation contradicts the code on this contract: AGENTS.md and both READMEs describe images served at /data/images with filesystem-relative data/images/... paths, Vite proxying /data/images, and formats limited to jpg/jpeg/png/webp, docs/design.md promises an { id, url, thumb_url } response and only jpg/png/webp, and deploy/nginx/wheremystuff.conf keeps a commented location /data/images/ block — none of which matches the /images mount, subdir-relative paths, or the avif allow-list.",
